---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CaptureForm from "../../components/forms/capture-form.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Evaluate your risk factors for gut dysbiosis.",
  canonical_url: null,
  featured_image: null,
  featured_image_alt: null,
  open_graph_type: "website",
  no_index: false,
};
---

<Layout title="Dysbiosis Risk Assessment" seo={seo}>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose">
    <h1>Microbiome Dysbiosis Risk Assessment</h1>
    <p>Gut dysbiosis occurs when the delicate balance of your gut microbiome is disrupted. This usually means a loss of beneficial bacteria (like <em>Bifidobacterium</em>), an overgrowth of potentially harmful bacteria or yeasts (like <em>Candida albicans</em>), or a loss of overall microbial diversity.</p>

    <h2>Primary Drivers of Dysbiosis</h2>
    <p>The microbiome is highly sensitive to lifestyle and environmental factors. The most significant drivers include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Antibiotic usage:</strong> Broad-spectrum antibiotics cannot differentiate between pathogenic and beneficial bacteria, effectively clear-cutting the microbial ecosystem.</li>
      <li><strong>Standard American Diet (SAD):</strong> Diets high in refined sugars and ultra-processed foods feed opportunistic pathogens while starving beneficial microbes of the prebiotic fiber they need to survive.</li>
      <li><strong>Chronic Stress:</strong> Cortisol and adrenaline alter gut motility and mucosal blood flow, changing the environment and altering the microbial composition.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="bg-brand-secondary p-6 rounded-lg my-8 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="mt-0">Evaluate Your Risk Factors</h2>
      <p>Select all the historical and lifestyle factors that apply to you. We'll generate a dysbiosis risk profile and send you targeted strategies for rebuilding a robust microbiome.</p>
      <CaptureForm form="waitlist" submitLabel="Get Risk Profile">
         <div class="mb-4 space-y-2">
          <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <input type="checkbox" name="history[]" value="antibiotics" />
            <span>Recent or frequent antibiotic use</span>
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <input type="checkbox" name="history[]" value="high_sugar" />
            <span>High sugar / processed food diet</span>
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <input type="checkbox" name="history[]" value="chronic_stress" />
            <span>Chronic stress</span>
          </label>
        </div>
        <label class="block mb-4">
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">Email address:</span>
          <input type="email" name="email" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 shadow-sm p-2" required />
        </label>
      </CaptureForm>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
